  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Concentrated nitric acid is a strong oxidizing agent.</p><p>Concentrated nitric acid also oxidises non&ndash;metals and their compounds. Iodine is oxidised to iodic acid.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mi>conc</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>HIO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
